+- Manual confirm64 B1-only at u180:
+  - B1 `0.4921875`
+- Automatic 16-pair dev eval at u240:
+  - B0 `1.000`
+  - B1 `0.500`
+  - B2 `1.000`
+  - B3 `0.750`
